Example: Allow full access to a bucket exclusively by a specified federated user
In this example, the federated user Alex is allowed full access to the examplebucket bucket and its objects.
All other users, including ‘root’, are explicitly denied all operations. Note however that ‘root’ is never denied
permissions to Put/Get/DeleteBucketPolicy.
